Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:28:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Vulkan FG input: let a pending carrier reach its retry
 past the relay

With the relay on, an unarmed evaluate ends inside FgRelayEvaluate, and the
relay arms nothing while the carrier is pending, so the retry never ran after
a failed first attempt. The race helper now triggers on ReShade's D3D12
init_device instead of polling dlss5-bridge.log, whose exclusive appends
dropped lines while the helper held the file open. File version 1.4.13.20.
---
