 src/version.rc                                |   4 +-
 .../vulkan-fg-quality/carrier-race-helper.cpp | 150 +++++++-----------
 tests/vulkan-fg-quality/run.cmd               |   2 +-
 tests/vulkan-fg-quality/test-carrier.cpp      |  23 +++
 5 files changed, 89 insertions(+), 99 deletions(-)

